# Spice 75

Based on [https://www.thecocktaildb.com/drink/…](https://www.thecocktaildb.com/drink/178322-Spice-75) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20251006140243/https://www.thecocktaildb.com/drink/178322-Spice-75))

{ rating="0" image="None" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

Note: serves 6

- [ ] 2 oz [syrup]{ ing="syrup" } (60 mL)

      - [ ] 4 Tbsp [sugar]{ ing="sugar" } (60 mL)
      - [ ] 2 Tbsp [water]{ ing="water" } (30 mL)
      - [ ] 1 Tbsp [allspice]{ ing="allspice" }
- [ ] 6 3/4 oz [rum]{ ing="rum" } (200 mL)
- [ ] 3 oz [lime juice]{ ing="lime-juice" } (90 mL)
- [ ] 20 oz [Champagne]{ ing="champagne" } (600 mL)
- [ ] [Orange Spiral garnish]{ ing="orange-spiral-garnish" }

## Recipe

1. In a pan, warm the [sugar]{ ing="sugar" }, [water]{ ing="water" }, and [allspice]{ ing="allspice" } until the sugar dissolves. Let cool and strain
1. Prep the orange spirals
1. Pout the spiced [syrup]{ ing="syrup" } into a cocktail shaker with [rum]{ ing="rum" } and [lime juice]{ ing="lime-juice" }
1. Add ice and shake. Strain into six [champagne]{ ing="champagne" } flutes
1. Top with champagne and add [garnish]{ ing="orange-spiral-garnish" }
